uro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5jPzU88Kg-oQ7kNvwGe1ZNI&_nc_oc=AdrCaMePXs0AJXv4VbtZV6PuwyaCKdQmvEmBXYBeLkTiU4fs2hqLmRyE2n34bhEY98c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHWetrsI9oKZ8GQDfuuEtq2zcmOqaL7xxV8Eu6G_Ql07w&oe=6A8D9423"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PhTNkAWmyNQQ7kNvwGewf4b&_nc_oc=AdpiNL-Fl_Jfu8ybn8MsjjAefXKHfJvopUfoePa_Q85PCVi_xMcigBL91GfcfBdX15c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHTHGilkodLNYaf_jls9dWzQkO0o1poS1J0ieHJ2piYjA&oe=6A8D801D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KxSR9mKvNmwQ7kNvwGyP4mo&_nc_oc=AdoKZRSDeXjiQHjv6MLWnJ3ZaFZh9yGkK6cwsRP7G7tRyxzL6WULkCQekpOtwnPVAD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHgke-prd0zkfjQmKFqmZqAEzu4xFG2d-A-hMd8iEa8MA&oe=6A8D6E8A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818874_1061729115797769_7442033601794403369_n.png?_nc_cat=109&c